The knowledge thereof is with my Lord in a record. My Lord neither errs nor forgets.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":52,"sd":null},{"k":"20:53","t":"[It is He] who has made for you the earth as a bed [spread out] and inserted therein for you roadways and sent down from the sky, rain and produced thereby categories of various plants.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":53,"sd":null},{"k":"20:54","t":"Eat [therefrom] and pasture your livestock. Indeed in that are signs for those of intelligence.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":54,"sd":null},{"k":"20:55","t":"From it [i.e., the earth] We created you, and into it We will return you, and from it We will extract you another time.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":55,"sd":null},{"k":"20:56","t":"And We certainly showed him [i.e., Pharaoh] Our signs - all of them - but he denied and refused.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":56,"sd":null},{"k":"20:57","t":"He said, \"Have you come to us to drive us out of our land with your magic, O Moses?","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":57,"sd":null},{"k":"20:58","t":"Then we will surely bring you magic like it, so make between us and you an appointment, which we will not fail to keep and neither will you, in a place assigned.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"20:59","t":"[Moses] said, \"Your appointment is on the day of the festival when the people assemble at mid-morning.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":59,"sd":null},{"k":"20:60","t":"So Pharaoh went away, put together his plan, and then came [to Moses].","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":60,"sd":null},{"k":"20:61","t":"Moses said to them [i.e., the magicians summoned by Pharaoh], \"Woe to you! Do not invent a lie against Allāh or He will exterminate you with a punishment; and he has failed who invents [such falsehood].\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":61,"sd":null},{"k":"20:62","t":"So they disputed over their affair among themselves and concealed their private conversation.","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":62,"sd":null},{"k":"20:63","t":"They said, \"Indeed, these are two magicians who want to drive you out of your land with their magic and do away with your most exemplary way [i.e., religion or tradition].","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":63,"sd":null},{"k":"20:64","t":"So resolve upon your plan and then come [forward] in line. And he has succeeded today who overcomes.\"","j":16,"h":32,"s":20,"a":64,"sd":null}],"juz":16,"hizb":32,"surahs":[20],"sajdah":false}